WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.700
We'll do it all

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.400
Everything

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.100
On our own

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.200
We don't need

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.500
Anything

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.900
Or anyone

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.600
If I lay here

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.500
If I just lay here

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:55.900
Would you lie with me and
just forget the world?

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.400
I don't quite know

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.000
How to say

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.600
How I feel

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.700
Those three words

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:28.400
Are said too much

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.200
They're not enough

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.300
If I lay here

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:43.600
If I just lay here

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:51.200
Would you lie with me and
just forget the world?

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.100
Forget what we're told

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.100
Before we get too old

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:09.400
Show me a garden that's
bursting into life

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.000
Let's waste time

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.700
Chasing cars

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:28.400
Around our heads

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.600
I need your grace

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.300
To remind me

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.900
To find my own

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.000
If I lay here

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.300
If I just lay here

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:05.000
Would you lie with me and
just forget the world?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.600
Forget what we're told

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.800
Before we get too old

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:23.400
Show me a garden that's
bursting into life

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.900
All that I am

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.400
All that I ever was

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:41.800
Is here in your perfect eyes,
they're all I can see

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:47.300
I don't know where

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.900
Confused about how as well

00:03:54.300 --> 00:04:00.200
Just know that these things will
never change for us at all

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.800
If I lay here

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:11.100
If I just lay here

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:18.900
Would you lie with me and
just forget the world?